---
// WhatsappFAQ.astro
---
<section class="py-24 bg-slate-50" id="faq">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Do I need to know accounting to use this?</h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 font-medium">No. You ask in plain language and get plain answers. The accounting happens underneath, in your Tally.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Which language can I use?</h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 font-medium">Any language works. Ask the way you'd naturally speak or type, English, Hindi, Hinglish, or your regional language, and you'll get a clear answer back.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Is my data safe?</h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 font-medium">Yes. AI Accountant is SOC 2 and ISO certified. Your data stays in your own Tally, nothing is recorded without your approval, and access is tied to your registered number.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Do I need to change my current accounting setup?</h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 font-medium">No. AI Accountant reads from your existing Tally. Nothing to change.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
